# Create a workflow, an agent in it, and a schedule, and see where the cursor goes after each.
key w
type landing
key Enter
key Enter
key Enter
type /tmp
key Enter
key Enter
key Up
key C-s
sleep 2s
key C-a
key c
type reply with the single word ok
key C-s
sleep 3s
key S
key c
type landing-probe
key Enter
type 0 9 * * 1-5
key Enter
key Enter
type say ok
key C-s
sleep 2s
